  m_text: "Hear that sound? That means one of your towers is <color=#FF2400>Degraded.</color>
    Your towers weaken over time until they reach a max. This is indicated by the        
    above their head. \nTo fix them, hover over to the <color=#FF2400>Degraded tower</color>
    and        right click it."
