  m_text: This is your tower menu. You can place your towers from here. Each tower
    costs different amounts of <color=#79D2DB>energy.</color>      Left click on
    a tower to select it, then       left click on the map to place it or       right
    click to cancel placement. After you place your first tower, the wave will start,
    so be prepared!
